{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>週末帶小朋友北上，不妨入住南山區的深圳華僑城洲際大酒店，不用轉車搬行李已夠玩足兩日。\n</p>\n<p>家庭主題房內設私人滑梯、電影投影幕及露台獨立遊樂場，小朋友入房即放電；家長則可在特大浴缸浸浴或到露台休息。戶外設有人造沙灘、泡泡池、小火車及旋轉木馬，翌日早上可對著錦鯉池歎自助早餐，吃飽去室內Playhouse又可以繼續玩了～</p>\n<p>🩵留言「fun」Send酒店優惠預訂連結給你～</p>\n<p>北上Check List ｜ 跟住呢個吃喝玩樂全指南，輕鬆北上玩轉大灣區同中國各大小城市！DM我哋分享你嘅獨特玩法！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179526245425770080_16181354156b0187f75381d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179526245425770080_16181354156b0187f75381d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@chingching_tora)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DgADcwXT0vL/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/klookhk-2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@klookhk</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/joykreator/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">JoyKreator</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/klookhk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">klookhk</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@chingching_tora資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DgADcwXT0vL/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 21 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:23:57.031122+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":417,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extra